{"seq":2,"slug":"score-evidence-data-collection","title":"指数评分证据与底层数据采集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ecodesign-repairability-right-to-repair/repairability-index/score-evidence-data-collection","wordCount":1749,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"指数评分证据与底层数据采集\">指数评分证据与底层数据采集</h1><p>分数是自评的，但自评不等于随便填。法国制度允许厂商自报维修指数，靠事后抽查与市场监督约束真实性（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Repairability_index\">维基百科，repairability index</a>）。这条设计的直接后果是：真正决定合规风险的，不是分数是多少，而是<strong>分数背后的证据能否被调出来</strong>。这一篇讲的是把五条标准各自需要的证据拆开，并设计采集路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>指数评分的数据采集有一个反直觉的特征：<strong>越难采的数据越早需要</strong>。备件价格、拆解步骤这类数据在产品开发阶段就要确定并归档，因为它们是产品属性的快照；而一旦产品上市、BOM 定型、供应链切换，回溯补齐这些数据几乎不可能——你无法在两年后准确还原某批次产品出厂时的拆解步骤与备件单价。</p>\n<p>因此指数证据的正确心智模型不是&quot;报送前的准备&quot;，而是<strong>产品开发流程里的一条并行数据流</strong>，与设计、采购、上市同步推进。它有三类源头：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>证据类别</th>\n<th>生产环节</th>\n<th>owner</th>\n<th>可变性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>拆解与工具数据</td>\n<td>结构设计/拆解评估</td>\n<td>研发</td>\n<td>设计变更后失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文档与手册</td>\n<td>技术写作/售后知识库</td>\n<td>售后文档</td>\n<td>版本化，可追溯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>备件可得性与价格</td>\n<td>备件计划/定价</td>\n<td>供应链+定价</td>\n<td>随供应策略变动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品类专属指标</td>\n<td>品类工程</td>\n<td>品类团队</td>\n<td>品类定义决定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三类源头的失效方式不同，这决定了采集策略必须分别设计。拆解数据在每次结构变更后失效，需要变更驱动的重评；文档数据是版本化的，需要版本与生效时间管理；备件数据是持续变动的，需要时点快照才能支撑&quot;当时报了多少分&quot;的举证。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[产品开发&lt;br/&gt;结构设计] --&gt; B[拆解评估&lt;br/&gt;步骤/工具/紧固件]&#10;  C[技术写作&lt;br/&gt;售后知识库] --&gt; D[文档证据&lt;br/&gt;版本+生效时间]&#10;  E[备件计划] --&gt; F[可得性快照&lt;br/&gt;年限/渠道]&#10;  G[定价系统] --&gt; H[备件价格快照&lt;br/&gt;相对整机比例]&#10;  B --&gt; I[证据清单&lt;br/&gt;evidence manifest]&#10;  D --&gt; I&#10;  F --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[分数计算]&#10;  J --&gt; K[分数公示]&#10;  I --&gt; L[抽查举证]\">flowchart TD\n  A[产品开发&lt;br/&gt;结构设计] --&gt; B[拆解评估&lt;br/&gt;步骤/工具/紧固件]\n  C[技术写作&lt;br/&gt;售后知识库] --&gt; D[文档证据&lt;br/&gt;版本+生效时间]\n  E[备件计划] --&gt; F[可得性快照&lt;br/&gt;年限/渠道]\n  G[定价系统] --&gt; H[备件价格快照&lt;br/&gt;相对整机比例]\n  B --&gt; I[证据清单&lt;br/&gt;evidence manifest]\n  D --&gt; I\n  F --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[分数计算]\n  J --&gt; K[分数公示]\n  I --&gt; L[抽查举证]</pre><h2 id=\"拆解类证据\">拆解类证据</h2><h3 id=\"采集发生在拆解台-不在系统里\">采集发生在拆解台，不在系统里</h3><p>拆解与工具这条标准的证据只能在物理世界上产生：由评估者按产品实际操作，记录到达每个可更换部件的步骤数、所需工具种类、紧固件类型与数量。结构化采集的关键是把结论落到<strong>部件级</strong>而不是整机级——因为同一台设备上，换电池和换屏幕的难度可能差很远，只有部件级记录才能支撑分数复核，也才能喂给第三章第二篇要讲的维修指引。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;teardown_assessment&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;sku&quot;: &quot;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;assessed_revision&quot;: &quot;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;assessor&quot;: &quot;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;assessed_at&quot;: &quot;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;target_parts&quot;: [&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;part_id&quot;: &quot;battery&quot;,&#10;        &quot;steps_to_reach&quot;: 0,&#10;        &quot;tools_required&quot;: [],&#10;        &quot;fastener_types&quot;: [],&#10;        &quot;reversible&quot;: true,&#10;        &quot;notes&quot;: &quot;&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    ]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"teardown_assessment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"assessed_revision\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"assessor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"assessed_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"target_parts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"part_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"battery\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"steps_to_reach\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"tools_required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"fastener_types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"reversible\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"notes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>assessed_revision</code> 是最容易被忽略却最重要的字段。拆解评估针对的是产品的某个具体修订版本；结构一旦变更，旧评估即失效。没有这个字段，就不会有任何机制发现&quot;评估过期了&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"设计变更触发重评的判定\">设计变更触发重评的判定</h3><p>把重评判定做成可自动化的规则，是防止评估过期的唯一可靠办法。判据不是&quot;任何 BOM 变更&quot;，而是<strong>影响拆解可达性的变更</strong>——外壳紧固方式、部件固定方式、连接器类型、密封胶使用。一个可落地的做法是在物料变更流程里加一个布尔判定字段，由结构工程师勾选。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE teardown_assessment (&#10;  assessment_id   bigserial PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  sku             text    NOT NULL,&#10;  assessed_revision text  NOT NULL,&#10;  assessed_at     date    NOT NULL,&#10;  expires_on_change boolean NOT NULL DEFAULT true&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE bom_change (&#10;  change_id     bigserial PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  sku           text    NOT NULL,&#10;  revision_from text    NOT NULL,&#10;  revision_to   text    NOT NULL,&#10;  affects_teardown boolean NOT NULL,&#10;  approved_at   date    NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 找出存在过期拆解评估的 SKU&#10;CREATE VIEW stale_teardown AS&#10;SELECT a.sku, a.assessed_revision, max(c.approved_at) AS latest_teardown_change&#10;FROM teardown_assessment a&#10;JOIN bom_change c ON c.sku = a.sku AND c.affects_teardown&#10;WHERE a.assessed_revision &lt;&gt; c.revision_to&#10;GROUP BY a.sku, a.assessed_revision;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> teardown_assessment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  assessment_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  assessed_revision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  assessed_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  expires_on_change </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bom_change</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  change_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  revision_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  revision_to   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  affects_teardown </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  approved_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 找出存在过期拆解评估的 SKU</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VIEW</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> stale_teardown</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">assessed_revision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">approved_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> latest_teardown_change</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> teardown_assessment a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bom_change c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">affects_teardown</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">assessed_revision</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">revision_to</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">assessed_revision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个视图输出的是&quot;分数可能已经不可辩护&quot;的 SKU 列表。它是把合规风险变成可查询集合的典型做法，比依赖人工记住&quot;那次改外壳之后有没有重评&quot;可靠得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"文档与备件证据\">文档与备件证据</h2><h3 id=\"文档证据要带版本与生效时间\">文档证据要带版本与生效时间</h3><p>文档类证据的特殊性在于它是<strong>版本化的</strong>：手册会修订、参数会更新。分数主张的是&quot;在产品销售的那个时点，维修资料是可获取的&quot;，所以证据必须能回答&quot;当时提供的是哪个版本&quot;。采集上要把文档与其版本、生效时间、公开范围一并记录——公开范围是第三条标准的判定依据，内部有手册但未公开等于不满足。</p>\n<h3 id=\"备件证据需要时点快照\">备件证据需要时点快照</h3><p>备件可得性与价格这两条标准的证据是持续变动的量，所以必须在评分时点做<strong>快照</strong>。快照要包含的不只是&quot;当前有货&quot;，而是承诺：供应年限、渠道覆盖、以及备件价格相对整机价格的比例。价格比例的采集有个实际难点——长尾备件往往没有独立定价，而评分需要全部备件都有价格视图，缺失会直接压低分数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;spare_parts_snapshot&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;sku&quot;: &quot;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;snapshot_at&quot;: &quot;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;commitment_years&quot;: 0,&#10;    &quot;channels&quot;: [&quot;authorized&quot;, &quot;independent&quot;, &quot;end-user&quot;],&#10;    &quot;parts&quot;: [&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;part_id&quot;: &quot;&quot;,&#10;        &quot;list_price&quot;: 0,&#10;        &quot;device_reference_price&quot;: 0,&#10;        &quot;price_ratio&quot;: 0,&#10;        &quot;available_from&quot;: &quot;&quot;,&#10;        &quot;available_until&quot;: &quot;&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    ]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"spare_parts_snapshot\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"snapshot_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"commitment_years\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"channels\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"authorized\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"independent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"end-user\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"parts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"part_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"list_price\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"device_reference_price\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"price_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"available_from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"available_until\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>available_until</code> 是这张快照与第三章备件义务的连接点。它把指数里的一个评分输入，变成了一份对未来的、可被消费者与维修商依赖的承诺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"品类专属指标与数据治理\">品类专属指标与数据治理</h2><h3 id=\"第五条标准的-owner-问题\">第五条标准的 owner 问题</h3><p>品类专属标准在治理上最容易落空，因为它没有固定的生产环节——前四条都有明确的对口系统，第五条依赖品类团队自己定义。可落地的做法是为每个品类维护一份指标定义，明确该条度量什么、证据从哪来、谁负责更新。</p>\n<h3 id=\"证据清单是分数的唯一辩护路径\">证据清单是分数的唯一辩护路径</h3><p>把上述四类证据汇总成一份<strong>证据清单</strong>（evidence manifest），并让分数记录引用它，是整个采集体系的核心设计。清单的作用是让&quot;这个分数凭什么&quot;这个问题有一条可走的路径：从分数到清单，从清单到各条标准的原始证据，从原始证据到生成它的系统与时间。</p>\n<p>需要留意的边界是：证据清单不应只是文件路径的堆积。每条引用应带类型、时间戳与责任人，否则抽查时会退回人工翻找。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>自评制度下，合规风险的核心是<strong>证据能否被调出</strong>，而非分数高低。</li>\n<li>越难采的数据越早需要：拆解与定价数据在产品开发阶段就要归档。</li>\n<li>拆解证据必须在<strong>部件级</strong>采集，并绑定产品修订版本。</li>\n<li>设计变更应通过 <code>affects_teardown</code> 类判定字段驱动重评，而不是靠人工记忆。</li>\n<li>文档证据要带版本与生效时间；公开范围是可得性判定的组成部分。</li>\n<li>备件证据必须做<strong>时点快照</strong>，包含承诺年限与价格比例，长尾备件定价缺失会直接压分。</li>\n<li>品类专属标准需要显式的指标定义与 owner，否则必然落空。</li>\n<li>分数应引用一份结构化证据清单，使&quot;凭什么&quot;有一条可走的辩护路径。</li>\n<li>分数采齐之后如何对外展示与宣称，见 <a href=\"repairability-score-display-claim\">评分展示与合规宣称</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"指数评分证据与底层数据采集","id":"指数评分证据与底层数据采集"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"拆解类证据","id":"拆解类证据"},{"level":3,"text":"采集发生在拆解台，不在系统里","id":"采集发生在拆解台-不在系统里"},{"level":3,"text":"设计变更触发重评的判定","id":"设计变更触发重评的判定"},{"level":2,"text":"文档与备件证据","id":"文档与备件证据"},{"level":3,"text":"文档证据要带版本与生效时间","id":"文档证据要带版本与生效时间"},{"level":3,"text":"备件证据需要时点快照","id":"备件证据需要时点快照"},{"level":2,"text":"品类专属指标与数据治理","id":"品类专属指标与数据治理"},{"level":3,"text":"第五条标准的 owner 问题","id":"第五条标准的-owner-问题"},{"level":3,"text":"证据清单是分数的唯一辩护路径","id":"证据清单是分数的唯一辩护路径"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"法国可维修指数/耐用性指数构成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ecodesign-repairability-right-to-repair/repairability-index/france-repairability-durability-index"},"next":{"title":"评分展示与合规宣称","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ecodesign-repairability-right-to-repair/repairability-index/repairability-score-display-claim"}}